WEBVTT

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.696
you can apply the method of self-talk.

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:04.296
You can talk to yourself
in the comfort of your room,

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.216
describing your plans for the weekend,
how your day has been,

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.376
or even take a random
picture from your phone

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.136
and describe the picture
to your imaginary friend.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.656
This is how polyglots learn languages,

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.536
and the best news is,
it's available to anyone

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.240
who is willing to take the learning
into their own hands.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.616
So meeting other polyglots
helped me realize

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.656
that it is really crucial
to find enjoyment

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.776
in the process of learning languages,

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.840
but also that joy in itself is not enough.